# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# COLLEGE BOARD CONTENT — never commit any of this.
#
# The app ships no question content. Every user imports their own PDF exports
# from the official SAT Suite Question Bank. Nothing below belongs in git, and
# once something is committed it stays in the history forever even if you
# delete it later — so this file matters more than any other file here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The question bank, the extracted images, and the source PDFs
Cat Sat/database/
Cat Sat/images/
Cat Sat/pdfs/
database/
images/
pdfs/

# SQLite in every form it takes. NOTE: "*.db" alone does NOT cover the
# write-ahead log or shared-memory files, and those can hold real question
# data. This was a real gap in the first version of this file.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# Any PDF anywhere — the Question Bank exports are PDFs
*.pdf

# Screenshots must come from the synthetic demo bank, never the real one.
# Regenerate with:  python "Cat Sat/dev_tests/shots.py"
Screenshots/*.png
!Screenshots/demo-*.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Normal ignores
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
Cat Sat/dev_tests/_sandbox/
Cat Sat/dev_tests/shots/

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Your own profile — scores, test dates, name. Never commit this.
Cat Sat/database/profile.json
database/profile.json
profile.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSONAL DATA — never commit any of this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A hand-written plan and a profile both contain one real student's test
# scores, weaknesses and schedule. They are also wrong for anybody else: the
# app generates a plan from each user's own score report instead.
Cat Sat/personal_plan.py
personal_plan.py
Cat Sat/database/profile.json
database/profile.json
profile.json

# The development changelog is written to one person, in the second person.
Cat Sat/UPGRADES.md
